      "text": "<math><mn>9</mn><mi>π</mi></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Parallelogram <math><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>R</mi></math> is a cyclic quadrilateral<br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> Parallelogram is a rectangle<br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#8736;</mi><mi>Q</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>90</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup></math><br />Let, the equation of the tangent from <math><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> to the ellipse is <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#177;</mo><msqrt><mn>16</mn><msup><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn></msqrt><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><msup><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8757;</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>h</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> locus of <math><mi>P</mi></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn></math></p><p>Hence, the area of locus of <math><mi>P</mi></math> is <math><mn>25</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></math>&nbsp;sq. units</p>",
    "image": null
  },
